{"lines": ["If you ever hear a sound nobody can name, do one thing before anything else. Keep listening.", "Summer, 1997. Underwater microphones in the Pacific pick up a sound that rises for about a minute. It is so loud that sensors more than five thousand kilometres apart hear it.", "The newspapers asked one question. What animal makes that? Today, NOAA's answer is not an animal at all.", "Seven sounds. Seven rules. And one of them has been coming out of the ocean since 1991, and still has no confirmed source.", "Stay to the end, and you'll hear which one."], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.08], ["you", 0.08, 0.22], ["ever", 0.22, 0.42], ["hear", 0.42, 0.64], ["a", 0.64, 0.8], ["sound", 0.8, 1.06], ["nobody", 1.06, 1.44], ["can", 1.44, 1.82], ["name,", 1.82, 2.12], ["do", 2.32, 2.42], ["one", 2.42, 2.6], ["thing", 2.6, 2.82], ["before", 2.82, 3.06], ["anything", 3.06, 3.36], ["else.", 3.36, 3.78], ["Keep", 4.3, 4.38], ["listening.", 4.38, 4.8], ["Summer,", 5.66, 5.94], ["1997.", 5.94, 6.92], ["Underwater", 7.84, 8.34], ["microphones", 8.34, 8.84], ["in", 8.84, 9.32], ["the", 9.32, 9.42], ["Pacific", 9.42, 9.76], ["pick", 9.76, 10.12], ["up", 10.12, 10.32], ["a", 10.32, 10.4], ["sound", 10.4, 10.7], ["that", 10.7, 11.02], ["rises", 11.02, 11.34], ["for", 11.34, 11.72], ["about", 11.72, 11.92], ["a", 11.92, 12.06], ["minute.", 12.06, 12.3], ["It", 12.86, 12.96], ["is", 12.96, 13.06], ["so", 13.06, 13.28], ["loud", 13.28, 13.62], ["that", 13.62, 13.9], ["sensors", 13.9, 14.2], ["more", 14.2, 14.6], ["than", 14.6, 14.78], ["five", 14.78, 14.96], ["thousand", 14.96, 15.14], ["kilometres", 15.14, 15.96], ["apart", 15.96, 16.38], ["hear", 16.38, 16.72], ["it.", 16.72, 16.92], ["The", 17.64, 17.74], ["newspapers", 17.74, 18.0], ["asked", 18.0, 18.62], ["one", 18.62, 18.94], ["question.", 18.94, 19.34], ["What", 19.92, 19.97], ["animal", 19.97, 20.24], ["makes", 20.24, 20.62], ["that?", 20.62, 20.92], ["Today,", 21.34, 21.52], ["NOAA's", 21.52, 21.9], ["answer", 21.9, 22.28], ["is